step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Herman Caranos</col> at the <col=800000>Piscatoris Fishing Colony</col> (north of <col=800000>Fairy ring</col> AKQ); <col=800000>cutscene</col> is optional.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Herman Caranos at the Piscatoris Fishing Colony (north of Fairy ring AKQ); cutscene is optional.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to the <col=800000>Wise Old Man</col> in <col=800000>Draynor Village</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Herman Caranos at the Piscatoris Fishing Colony (north of Fairy ring AKQ); cutscene is optional.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Return to the Colony and talk to the Wise Old Man.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Herman Caranos at the Piscatoris Fishing Colony (north of Fairy ring AKQ); cutscene is optional.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Colony and talk to the Wise Old Man.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Kill the level 79 <col=800000>Sea Trolls</col> and enter the Colony (collect 7 of their bones if needed).</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Herman Caranos at the Piscatoris Fishing Colony (north of Fairy ring AKQ); cutscene is optional.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Colony and talk to the Wise Old Man.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the level 79 Sea Trolls and enter the Colony (collect 7 of their bones if needed).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to Herman (east building). Note: You will need to click inside of the building as clicking directly on Herman (or the Wise Old Man later) will make your character run outside the building to the north.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Talk to Herman Caranos at the Piscatoris Fishing Colony (north of Fairy ring AKQ); cutscene is optional.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Colony and talk to the Wise Old Man.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the level 79 Sea Trolls and enter the Colony (collect 7 of their bones if needed).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Herman (east building). Note: You will need to click inside of the building as clicking directly on Herman (or the Wise Old Man later) will make your character run outside the building to the north.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Franklin Caranos</col> near the entrance.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Talk to Herman Caranos at the Piscatoris Fishing Colony (north of Fairy ring AKQ); cutscene is optional.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.</str>
line	
