line	<str>Kill the level 79 Sea Trolls and enter the Colony (collect 7 of their bones if needed).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Herman (east building). Note: You will need to click inside of the building as clicking directly on Herman (or the Wise Old Man later) will make your character run outside the building to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Franklin Caranos near the entrance.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a log on the firebox (not the furnace) and light it in the building with the Furnace symbol. (Franklin will give you a tinderbox if you speak to him again.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Use each of the five iron bars on the Metal Press.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use iron sheets to repair the western colony perimeter's broken walls. (Franklin will give you a hammer.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Arnold Lydspor in the bank. (He will give you a Small fishing net if you do not already have one.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish 5 fresh monkfish at the fishing spot to the north-west, you may need a few more if you burn some while cooking.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cook the monkfish in the kitchen, south of the fishing spot. Note: you cannot bank with Arnold to make use of cooking gauntlets.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Arnold.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Franklin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Wise Old Man and Herman in the far eastern building.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Wizard Frumscone in the basement of the Wizards' Guild in Yanille.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Malignius Mortifer south of Falador. He will give you a brown apron in order to be allowed entry to the Crafting Guild.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Master Crafter with dreadlocks in the Crafting Guild on the east side.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use Pot and Pot Lid together to make Airtight Pot.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Malignius Mortifer to teleport back to the Fishing Colony.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to Herman to begin the fight.</col>
